        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Merano Door Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simplistic lever will fit standard door preparations. It is available in 5 finishes which make matching it to any decor an easy task. Made out of brass, Schlage's Merano Leverset features a classic beauty that makes it a good choice for traditional as well as more contemporary style homes. The universal latch fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage Merano door levers are resistant to tarnishing, discoloration and corrosion. Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Merano Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece lever for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of the F-Series Schlage Merano Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Lever Function is Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Merano Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
